  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7db0df5408222c448ba882eb111f0f1e, type: 3}
  m_Name: EconomicHearMore02
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  hearMoreName: EconomicHearMore02
  hearMoreText: "Cutting corners might seem efficient in the short term, but it creates
    long-term problems that drain both money and resources. When teams rush development
    or skip maintenance, technical debt builds up \u2014 making future updates slower
    and more expensive. Over time, these choices increase the risk of outages and
    failures, turning short-term savings into long-term losses."
